sequenceDiagram
 participant P as Production/Agent
 participant J as S26 Job
 participant F as S23 Budget
 participant Q as S22 Quota
 participant C as S27 Connector
 participant V as Provider
 P->>J: Create attempt + request hash
 J->>F: Reserve budget (idempotent)
 F-->>J: Reservation
 J->>Q: Acquire permit
 Q-->>J: Reserved permit
 J->>J: Persist submission intent + outbox
 J->>F: Confirm authorization
 F-->>J: Durable authorization
 J->>Q: Confirm dispatch/inflight permit
 Q-->>J: Durable permit acknowledgment
 J->>C: Fenced dispatch grant
 C->>J: Claim grant once
 C->>V: Submit with stable provider key if supported
 alt Response lost and provider lacks idempotency
  C-->>J: Submission unknown
  J->>J: Retain budget and permit, reconcile without resubmit
 else Authoritative terminal
  V-->>C: Status/result
  C-->>J: Verified observation
  J->>F: Accrue/settle + release remaining reserve
  J->>Q: Release terminal permit
 end
